<title>USA: Amerac Energy increases credit facility.</title>
<headline>Amerac Energy increases credit facility.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amerac Energy Corp said Tuesday it has increased its credit facility to $50 million from $30 million.</p>
<p>The amount currently outstanding under the facility is about $7.5 million, it said.</p>
<p>&quot;The increase in our line of credit allows us to continue our strategy of aggressive growth through acquisitions,&quot; President and Chief Executive Jeffrey Robinson said in a statement.</p>
</text>
